WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.700
Thanks for the food.

2
00:00:06.699 --> 00:00:09.700
All right. Now that we’re all stuffed,

3
00:00:09.766 --> 00:00:11.866
what do you say we train for our Gym battle?

4
00:00:11.933 --> 00:00:14.700
- Pikachu!
- In that case...

5
00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:19.366
- Fennekin!
- Pancham!

6
00:00:19.433 --> 00:00:22.733
Why don’t we practice our Pokémon performance?

7
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.466
So I think I’ll work on some new inventions.

8
00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:29.433
Hey, Clemont, is it okay if I go and explore the forest?

9
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.966
- I guess so, but don’t get into trouble.
- Heh, of course I won’t.

10
00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:37.400
Dedenne will be with me. We’ll be fine!

11
00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:41.833
There’s got to be a gazillion Pokémon living in this forest.

12
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:44.466
Hi there, Wormadam. Have a nice day.

13
00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:47.766
Hm!

14
00:00:48.766 --> 00:00:50.933
Huh?

15
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.166
You’re not allowed to go this way.

16
00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:54.933
Huh?

17
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

18
00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.466
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

19
00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:04.233
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

20
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.300
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

21
00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:10.399
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

22
00:01:10.466 --> 00:01:13.600
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

23
00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:17.000
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

24
00:01:17.066 --> 00:01:19.433
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

25
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.933
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

26
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

27
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.533
While our heroes continue their trek to Coumarine City,

28
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.600
site of Ash’s next Gym battle,

29
00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:45.666
Bonnie and Dedenne have just come across a group of kids in the forest.

30
00:01:45.733 --> 00:01:48.666
Hey, why aren’t we allowed to go that way?

31
00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:51.033
- It’s our opinion.
- Opinion?

32
00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.566
Hey, Kye, I think you mean our dominion.

33
00:01:53.633 --> 00:01:55.766
Yeah, that’s right, it’s our dominion.

34
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:59.866
- Okay, what do you mean by that?
- What do I mean by that?

35
00:01:59.933 --> 00:02:02.733
For real? How am I supposed to know?

36
00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:08.199
You see, our dominion means that this place belongs to us and us alone.

37
00:02:08.266 --> 00:02:11.933
That doesn’t make sense. The forest doesn’t belong to anybody.

38
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.166
Who do you think you are? Do you dare argue with the Lapras Defense Force?

39
00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:18.533
Huh, Lapras Defense Force?

40
00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:21.400
Hey, Does that mean, there’s a Lapras around here?

41
00:02:21.466 --> 00:02:24.200
- Ah!
- How could you possibly know that?

42
00:02:24.266 --> 00:02:28.200
Huh? 'Cause you called yourselves the Lapras Defense Force.

43
00:02:28.266 --> 00:02:32.799
- I thought you were just a dumb kid.
- But it turns out you’re really smart.

44
00:02:32.866 --> 00:02:35.533
Maybe it would be better if she were on our side.

45
00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.933
Tell me your name.

46
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.400
I think it’s rude if you don’t tell me your name before I tell you my name.

47
00:02:41.466 --> 00:02:44.533
Mm, that’s not very nice. My name’s Heidi.

48
00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.633
- And I’m Kye.
- And my name is Jay.

49
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.633
Well, Bonnie’s my name.

50
00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.500
- And this is Dedenne.
- Na-na-na!

51
00:02:52.566 --> 00:02:55.500
-So how do you have a Pokémon?

52
00:02:55.566 --> 00:02:58.566
Well, Dedenne is my big brother Clemont’s Pokémon,

53
00:02:58.633 --> 00:03:01.066
but he asked me if I’d take care of it.

54
00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:04.633
He asked you to? Wait, Bonnie, are you a grown-up?

55
00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.066
That’s incredible.

56
00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:10.133
Oh, I’ve got an idea. I’ll let you join the Lapras Defense Force

57
00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.799
if you let me pet Dedenne.

58
00:03:11.866 --> 00:03:15.266
Dedenne just loves to be petted. Here!

59
00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.666
Uh, ha-ha. You okay?

60
00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:32.066
Oh, please! See? I’m fine. Only a true grown-up could go through all of that.

61
00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:34.133
Then you must be a grown-up, too.

62
00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.433
- So now you’re one of us, Blondie.
- Uh, it’s Bonnie.

63
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.633
- Would you let me pet Dedenne, too?
- Yeah, me too.

64
00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.899
Okay, sure.

65
00:03:44.766 --> 00:03:46.666
Huh? What was that?

66
00:03:46.733 --> 00:03:50.899
Come with us. We’ll take you along to our hideout.

67
00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:57.500
- Ah! It’s a lake. So pretty.
- Na-na!

68
00:03:57.566 --> 00:04:00.633
Now, Lapras Defense Force, time to move out!

69
00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.433
Roger!

70
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.666
- Huh?
- Water-mode.

71
00:04:05.733 --> 00:04:08.433
- Activated!
- We’re ready for action.

72
00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:11.066
Hey, wait a sec. I want to change, too.

73
00:04:13.433 --> 00:04:15.066
Okay, I’m ready.

74
00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:18.000
Lapras Defense Force, let’s move out!

75
00:04:18.066 --> 00:04:19.166
Roger.

76
00:04:23.533 --> 00:04:26.300
Okay, Heidi, so where’s Lapras anyway?

77
00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.466
- Lapras is right here.
- Huh?

78
00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.599
See? There it is.

79
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:34.333
- Huh?
- Na-na!

80
00:04:40.599 --> 00:04:43.066
It’s Lapras!

81
00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:45.099
- Awesome!
- Na-na!

82
00:04:46.133 --> 00:04:48.599
So this is where Lapras lives, right?

83
00:04:48.666 --> 00:04:50.599
- No, you’re wrong.
- Huh?

84
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:53.766
- Should I tell you?
- Yeah, tell me, tell me!

85
00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:56.599
- Hm. Should I tell her?
- Huh?

86
00:04:56.666 --> 00:05:00.133
- Hey. Come on. Tell me.
- Go on and tell her.

87
00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:03.200
- Well, if I have to.
- Mm-hm.

88
00:05:03.266 --> 00:05:07.266
The day after this big storm, we were walking through the forest,

89
00:05:07.333 --> 00:05:11.733
when we found these huge tracks on the ground and then...

90
00:05:14.066 --> 00:05:17.566
- I’m feeling kind of scared.
- Well, don’t be.

91
00:05:19.099 --> 00:05:22.599
- I want to go back home.
- Come on, Heidi.

92
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:24.500
Oh!

93
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:27.800
- That’s...
- A Lapras.

94
00:05:30.866 --> 00:05:34.599
- I’ve never seen one before.
- Hey, come here.

95
00:05:34.666 --> 00:05:37.099
There’s nothing to be afraid of.

96
00:05:40.866 --> 00:05:44.633
Can I pet you, please?

97
00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.900
Oh, you’re so nice and smooth!

98
00:05:46.966 --> 00:05:50.900
- Hey. Look there.
- Oh, it’s hurt.

99
00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:56.466
Don’t worry, Lapras. We’ll take care of your wound right away.

100
00:05:56.533 --> 00:05:58.533
Yeah.

101
00:05:59.533 --> 00:06:01.766
Wowee, that’s so cool.

102
00:06:01.833 --> 00:06:05.200
And that’s why, so we could protect Lapras.

103
00:06:05.266 --> 00:06:08.266
The three of us swarmed the Lapras Defense Force.

104
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:09.700
No, we formed it!

105
00:06:09.766 --> 00:06:14.466
Yay. Wow, that’s so sweet. I’m glad they’re good to you, Lapras.

106
00:06:23.233 --> 00:06:25.200
Whoa!

107
00:06:28.466 --> 00:06:31.633
I don’t get it. Why are you keeping Lapras a secret?

108
00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:35.366
You don’t get it, do you? There’s only one reason Lapras got hurt.

109
00:06:35.433 --> 00:06:38.299
Some bad Pokémon hunters are after it.

110
00:06:38.366 --> 00:06:42.366
- Along with Pokémon snugglers.
- No, that’s Pokémon smugglers.

111
00:06:42.433 --> 00:06:46.766
And besides, who knows what will happen if grown-ups knew Lapras was here?

112
00:06:46.833 --> 00:06:48.233
Huh? What do you mean?

113
00:06:48.299 --> 00:06:51.033
All grown-ups are grown-up liars.

114
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.200
- Na-na!
- It’s raining.

115
00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.066
-Pikachu!

116
00:07:02.133 --> 00:07:04.700
You didn’t happen to see Bonnie, did you?

117
00:07:04.766 --> 00:07:06.599
Huh? Come to think of it, no.

118
00:07:06.666 --> 00:07:10.033
She said she was going to explore the forest, but hasn’t come back.

119
00:07:10.099 --> 00:07:12.700
I hope she’s at least staying out of the rain.

120
00:07:12.766 --> 00:07:15.066
- Let’s go look for her.
- Pika.

121
00:07:16.133 --> 00:07:18.799
Hey, who lives in here?

122
00:07:18.866 --> 00:07:21.799
- Oh, this is our white out.
- You mean our hideout.

123
00:07:21.866 --> 00:07:24.866
Now can I have some? You know what I mean.

124
00:07:24.933 --> 00:07:26.799
I don't know what you’re talking about.

125
00:07:26.866 --> 00:07:28.099
Don’t give me that!

126
00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:32.033
You always keep candy in your pocket, so give me some right now.

127
00:07:32.099 --> 00:07:35.599
Oh, yeah. Heidi’s right! Just a piece!

128
00:07:35.666 --> 00:07:39.366
Oh, all right, but you can only have one each.

129
00:07:39.433 --> 00:07:45.099
Don’t be stingy. Lapras, here. This’ll cheer you up.

130
00:07:48.366 --> 00:07:50.166
Is it yummy?

131
00:07:51.599 --> 00:07:55.099
- And you can have some, too.
- Ah, thanks.

132
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:57.633
- And one for Dedenne.
- Na-na!

133
00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.533
-Hey, there won’t be any left.

134
00:08:01.599 --> 00:08:04.733
Thanks a lot, Jay. That’s really nice of you.

135
00:08:04.799 --> 00:08:07.533
Nice? Well, I guess you can say that.

136
00:08:07.599 --> 00:08:11.099
Ready, Lapras Defense Force? Eat candy now!

137
00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:13.533
Roger!

138
00:08:13.599 --> 00:08:15.900
Yummy!

139
00:08:17.466 --> 00:08:19.500
Look. It stopped raining.

140
00:08:19.566 --> 00:08:22.933
Great. Let’s all play some more, Lapras.

141
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.500
-Huh?

142
00:08:24.566 --> 00:08:25.900
Not again.

143
00:08:25.966 --> 00:08:30.366
Sometimes Lapras will start to cry like it’s really, really sad about something.

144
00:08:30.433 --> 00:08:33.933
But the problem is we have no idea why.

145
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.866
Lapras, what’s wrong?

146
00:08:36.933 --> 00:08:39.600
Hey, its skin feels warmer than it should.

147
00:08:39.666 --> 00:08:42.199
- Huh?
- Wow, you’re right. It’s hot.

148
00:08:42.266 --> 00:08:47.266
- Maybe its wound didn’t heal completely.
- Then we need to get someone to help us.

149
00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.833
No way. We can’t tell the grown-ups.

150
00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:52.833
- Hey. Bonnie!
- Where are you?

151
00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:56.833
Huh? We can tell if they’re not grown-ups, right?

152
00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.533
Huh?

153
00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.066
Lapras, the Transport Pokémon.

154
00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:05.600
Lapras enjoys carrying people on its back

155
00:09:05.666 --> 00:09:08.366
and it understands what people are saying.

156
00:09:08.433 --> 00:09:12.199
It’s really burning up. It’s not something we can deal with.

157
00:09:12.266 --> 00:09:13.833
-Pikachu!

158
00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.500
Oh, that poor Pokémon.

159
00:09:15.566 --> 00:09:18.433
I think we’d better get Nurse Joy right away.

160
00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:21.400
- Good idea.
- You can’t do that.

161
00:09:21.466 --> 00:09:23.000
But why can’t we?

162
00:09:23.066 --> 00:09:26.633
- 'Cause you can’t trust any grown-ups.
- They’re all liars!

163
00:09:26.699 --> 00:09:29.900
We once found an Eevee that someone had abandoned.

164
00:09:29.966 --> 00:09:32.866
We hid it behind our classroom, while the three of us took care of it.

165
00:09:32.933 --> 00:09:37.466
But one day, our teacher found out when we were bringing Eevee some food.

166
00:09:37.533 --> 00:09:39.566
She promised she wouldn’t do anything,

167
00:09:39.633 --> 00:09:42.699
as long as we told her what we were doing.

168
00:09:42.766 --> 00:09:45.766
But as soon as we did, she took Eevee away.

169
00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:48.733
And those grown-ups will take Lapras away, too.

170
00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:51.800
I see, but you know Lapras needs help.

171
00:09:51.866 --> 00:09:53.500
Oh, Lapras, are you okay?

172
00:09:53.566 --> 00:09:55.600
We can’t just stand around and do nothing.

173
00:09:55.666 --> 00:09:58.833
- Lapras is going downhill fast.
- Pika! Pika!

174
00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.466
- Oh no, does that mean...?
- Huh?

175
00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:03.199
Uh, I’d rather not think about it.

176
00:10:03.266 --> 00:10:06.566
- No way!
- No. That can’t be true!

177
00:10:06.633 --> 00:10:08.199
Don’t lie to us.

178
00:10:08.266 --> 00:10:10.833
No, I won’t believe it. I won't!

179
00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:14.199
-You’re all a bunch of meanies.

180
00:10:14.266 --> 00:10:16.800
Hey, I’m sorry. Oh, man!

181
00:10:16.866 --> 00:10:21.566
Ash said everything he said because he really cares about Lapras like you do.

182
00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:24.800
Getting the help that Lapras needs is the best thing we can do.

183
00:10:24.866 --> 00:10:29.300
So is it okay if we go and get Nurse Joy?

184
00:10:29.366 --> 00:10:31.233
Okay.

185
00:10:33.366 --> 00:10:35.533
What good is just one going to do us?

186
00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:39.833
- I’m afraid one is all they had left.
- Shall we split it into thirds?

187
00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.800
Don’t go mathematical on me!

188
00:10:41.866 --> 00:10:44.733
Rock-paper-scissors wins it all and that’s that.

189
00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.199
Fine with me!

190
00:10:46.266 --> 00:10:47.966
And the winner chows down.

191
00:10:48.033 --> 00:10:49.566
And Rock!

192
00:10:49.633 --> 00:10:51.266
Inkay!

193
00:10:52.833 --> 00:10:57.600
Nurse Joy. It’s Lapras! We’ve got an emergency!

194
00:11:00.066 --> 00:11:03.166
Who’s that Pokémon?

195
00:11:06.066 --> 00:11:08.100
It’s Lapras.

196
00:11:14.633 --> 00:11:18.366
Lapras’s wound is closed, but some germs must have gotten in.

197
00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:19.900
That explains the fever.

198
00:11:19.966 --> 00:11:21.933
- Nurse Joy?
- What does that mean?

199
00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.466
- Will it be all right?
- Oh, don’t worry.

200
00:11:24.533 --> 00:11:27.433
- Lapras will be just fine.
- Really?

201
00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.366
- Promise.
- Yeah!

202
00:11:35.566 --> 00:11:37.866
Wow! Looks like it’s fine.

203
00:11:37.933 --> 00:11:40.933
I’ll be getting on back to the Pokémon Center now.

204
00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.800
- Thanks, Nurse.
- Nurse Joy, thank you.

205
00:11:43.866 --> 00:11:45.266
We’re so happy.

206
00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:48.366
- Guess some grown-ups are nice.
- You’re wonderful.

207
00:11:48.433 --> 00:11:50.733
Don’t forget, the three of you are the ones

208
00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:54.133
who gave Lapras such excellent care, but thank you.

209
00:11:55.633 --> 00:11:58.633
- You’re making me crush.
- Kye, you mean blush.

210
00:11:58.699 --> 00:12:02.333
Oh, yes. The Eevee that you found and took such wonderful care of?

211
00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:06.400
I returned it to its Trainer and I’m happy to report it’s doing very well.

212
00:12:06.466 --> 00:12:08.933
Huh? How do you know about our Eevee?

213
00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:12.000
Well, your teacher brought it to me to see if I knew its Trainer,

214
00:12:12.066 --> 00:12:14.566
so I took it back to its home as soon as I could.

215
00:12:14.633 --> 00:12:15.900
Our teacher?

216
00:12:15.966 --> 00:12:18.566
- So she didn’t...
- Take it away from us?

217
00:12:18.633 --> 00:12:20.933
Lapras on the loose.

218
00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:23.933
A Pokémon we could put to very good use.

219
00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.466
Let’s catch it. Without excuse.

220
00:12:26.533 --> 00:12:28.800
Wobbuff--

221
00:12:31.333 --> 00:12:32.633
Huh?

222
00:12:32.699 --> 00:12:36.400
Lapras is crying again.

223
00:12:36.466 --> 00:12:38.766
It sounds so sad.

224
00:12:38.833 --> 00:12:41.466
According to the story we were told earlier,

225
00:12:41.533 --> 00:12:44.300
Lapras was swept into the forest during a storm.

226
00:12:44.366 --> 00:12:48.566
- Mm-hm.
- Forest, river. Hm!

227
00:12:48.633 --> 00:12:51.766
- Maybe it wants to return to the ocean.
- Huh?

228
00:12:51.833 --> 00:12:56.000
I wouldn’t be surprised if its family and friends are living out at sea.

229
00:12:56.066 --> 00:12:58.666
- You might be right.
- Of course.

230
00:12:58.733 --> 00:13:02.533
Hey, Lapras, do you miss all your friends?

231
00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.666
Okay. Then let’s get Lapras back out to sea.

232
00:13:07.733 --> 00:13:08.833
Huh?

233
00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.199
- No. No. No!
- Wait. You can't do that.

234
00:13:11.266 --> 00:13:13.833
- Lapras is our friend.
- We won’t stand for it.

235
00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:17.266
But think for a moment about how Lapras feels right now.

236
00:13:17.333 --> 00:13:19.566
- How Lapras feels?
- Mm-hm.

237
00:13:19.633 --> 00:13:23.133
There’s no doubt that Lapras cares about you a lot, but I think

238
00:13:23.199 --> 00:13:26.566
it’s feeling pretty homesick and wants to go back to where it comes from.

239
00:13:26.633 --> 00:13:28.933
Lapras wants to go home?

240
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.966
After you finish playing together,

241
00:13:31.033 --> 00:13:33.400
you always want to go back home, right?

242
00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:38.766
- Heidi?
- I love Lapras.

243
00:13:38.833 --> 00:13:41.900
So if it’s homesick, I want to help.

244
00:13:41.966 --> 00:13:45.699
Whatever it takes, I want to help Lapras get back home.

245
00:13:45.766 --> 00:13:48.900
- It's the right thing to do.
- That’s right.

246
00:13:48.966 --> 00:13:50.199
I’ll help, too.

247
00:13:50.266 --> 00:13:53.599
Great. Sounds like a job for the Lapras Defense Force.

248
00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:55.699
- Na-na!
- Pikachu!

249
00:13:55.766 --> 00:13:57.266
Now, let’s see.

250
00:13:57.333 --> 00:14:01.766
This lake connects to a big river, so if we follow it downstream,

251
00:14:01.833 --> 00:14:04.000
we should reach the ocean.

252
00:14:04.066 --> 00:14:05.633
Great job, Serena.

253
00:14:05.699 --> 00:14:08.233
- Let’s do this, guys.
- Pika! Pika!

254
00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:10.133
Yeah.

255
00:14:14.566 --> 00:14:16.900
- Huh?
- Pika?

256
00:14:16.966 --> 00:14:19.266
Check it out.

257
00:14:19.333 --> 00:14:22.699
Maybe Lapras couldn’t get home because that boulder was in the way.

258
00:14:22.766 --> 00:14:27.133
So let’s get it out of the way. Froakie, Hawlucha, let’s go!

259
00:14:28.533 --> 00:14:31.000
- Froakie!
- Cha!

260
00:14:31.066 --> 00:14:35.466
- I think we can help, too.
- Fennekin, you’re up!

261
00:14:35.533 --> 00:14:37.833
- Ches!
- Lu!

262
00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:38.966
Fenn!

263
00:14:39.033 --> 00:14:42.533
Okay. Froakie, use Cut and, Hawlucha, use High Jump Kick.

264
00:14:42.599 --> 00:14:45.966
Chespin, use Tackle! And Luxio, use Wild Charge!

265
00:14:46.033 --> 00:14:48.400
Now, Fennekin, use Scratch.

266
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.000
-All right!

267
00:15:06.566 --> 00:15:08.566
Ah!

268
00:15:09.666 --> 00:15:13.766
If we follow that river straight downstream, we’ll reach the ocean.

269
00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:15.300
- Oh, no you won’t!
- Huh?

270
00:15:15.366 --> 00:15:18.099
Prepare for trouble, your good times are through.

271
00:15:18.166 --> 00:15:20.533
And make it double, doo-be-doo-be-doo!

272
00:15:20.599 --> 00:15:23.033
To protect the world from devastation.

273
00:15:23.099 --> 00:15:25.800
To put you twerpies on probation.

274
00:15:25.866 --> 00:15:28.766
To denounce the evils of truth and love.

275
00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:31.466
This motto stuff fits me like a glove.

276
00:15:32.533 --> 00:15:34.500
- It's Jessie.
- Meowth.

277
00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:37.666
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

278
00:15:37.733 --> 00:15:40.866
Surrender now or you can go fly a kite!

279
00:15:40.933 --> 00:15:42.599
Wobbuffet!

280
00:15:42.666 --> 00:15:44.966
Team Rocket, what do you want?

281
00:15:45.033 --> 00:15:48.233
- Why are you one short?
- Order in the court!

282
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.766
Catching Lapras is our favorite sport.

283
00:15:50.833 --> 00:15:53.466
Thanks in advance for your twerpish support.

284
00:15:53.533 --> 00:15:56.333
Oh, no, you don’t! Pikachu, Electro Ball!

285
00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:57.800
Pika!

286
00:15:57.866 --> 00:15:59.633
Pumpkaboo. Shadow Ball.

287
00:16:04.433 --> 00:16:08.000
We'll take care of Team Rocket. You guys need to keep going.

288
00:16:08.066 --> 00:16:10.000
- But--
- You take care of Lapras.

289
00:16:10.066 --> 00:16:12.566
And we’ll make certain Team Rocket doesn’t win.

290
00:16:12.633 --> 00:16:15.366
We’re counting on the Lapras Defense Force!

291
00:16:15.433 --> 00:16:17.599
Roger that, Ash!

292
00:16:17.666 --> 00:16:19.766
Let’s go, Lapras!

293
00:16:20.766 --> 00:16:25.166
Ha, you think you can keep a good team down? Think again.

294
00:16:27.333 --> 00:16:29.900
- Splish-splash!
- They got away.

295
00:16:29.966 --> 00:16:32.033
Look.

296
00:16:32.099 --> 00:16:33.699
The ocean.

297
00:16:33.766 --> 00:16:38.166
- Just a little farther.
- Ooh. It’s the big one.

298
00:16:38.233 --> 00:16:40.533
Inkay!

299
00:16:40.599 --> 00:16:42.133
He’s part of Team Rocket, too!

300
00:16:42.199 --> 00:16:45.833
Lapras is our catch of the day. Inkay, Psybeam, okay?

301
00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.599
Inkay!

302
00:16:54.666 --> 00:16:58.433
Sorry to keep you waiting!

303
00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:02.699
-It’s Lapras-picking season.

304
00:17:02.766 --> 00:17:04.800
- Lapras!
- Lapras, no!

305
00:17:04.866 --> 00:17:06.733
- Aprons up.
- That’s weapons.

306
00:17:08.333 --> 00:17:11.200
- Lapras!
- Na-na-na!

307
00:17:11.266 --> 00:17:14.433
- Lapras, what’s wrong with you?
- Hey, everything’s going to be fine.

308
00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:17.599
- Stay back!
- Stop gumming up the works.

309
00:17:17.666 --> 00:17:19.399
Lapras, what do we do?

310
00:17:22.433 --> 00:17:25.933
Hold on. Jay, do you still have any candy left?

311
00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:28.600
- Yeah, but why do you ask?
- Give fast.

312
00:17:31.066 --> 00:17:36.133
Lapras, look what I’ve got. It’s candy! Eat it. It’ll make you feel better.

313
00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.966
Oh! Oh!

314
00:17:39.033 --> 00:17:41.500
- It works every time.

315
00:17:41.566 --> 00:17:44.433
- Now you’re happy.
- Party pooper!

316
00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:48.133
We’ve got to get away. Bye-bye!

317
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:51.966
- I don’t think so.
- Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball.

318
00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:55.666
Move left and dodge!

319
00:18:01.166 --> 00:18:02.833
- Yes!
- Way to go, Lapras.

320
00:18:02.899 --> 00:18:05.433
- You’re the coolest.
- Coolest, my foot!

321
00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.166
- All right, Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse.
- Okay, Inkay, use Psybeam.

322
00:18:09.233 --> 00:18:10.833
- Pumpka!
- Inkay!

323
00:18:10.899 --> 00:18:13.000
Look out!

324
00:18:13.066 --> 00:18:15.500
Huh?

325
00:18:19.500 --> 00:18:21.700
It looks like your friends came here to help you.

326
00:18:21.766 --> 00:18:23.133
A convention!

327
00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.566
This is a great chance to get a matched set.

328
00:18:31.966 --> 00:18:35.899
- They’re strong!
- That was one big-time Ice Beam.

329
00:18:35.966 --> 00:18:38.233
- Ash, look!

330
00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:42.333
I guess Lapras’s family was waiting for it to come back home.

331
00:18:42.399 --> 00:18:44.166
Wow. Thank goodness!

332
00:18:44.233 --> 00:18:46.033
Pikachu, Electro Ball.

333
00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.933
Pika! Pi! Pika! Pi!

334
00:18:49.933 --> 00:18:52.433
We’re blasting off again!

335
00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.466
Wobbuffet!

336
00:18:56.433 --> 00:18:57.933
All right!

337
00:19:07.266 --> 00:19:10.800
Lapras looks happy. I’m glad for them all.

338
00:19:10.866 --> 00:19:12.966
- Mm.
- I’m glad too.

339
00:19:13.033 --> 00:19:14.700
Isn’t that the best?

340
00:19:18.633 --> 00:19:20.600
You came back.

341
00:19:20.666 --> 00:19:24.266
Lapras!

342
00:19:24.333 --> 00:19:28.433
- Take good care!
- And please don’t get lost next time.

343
00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.533
- Let’s meet again someday.
- That would be great.

344
00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:38.600
Okay, you can go now. They’re waiting.

345
00:19:38.666 --> 00:19:41.666
We’ll see you later, Lapras. Bye-bye, now.

346
00:19:51.766 --> 00:19:54.766
I wonder if we’ll see it again someday.

347
00:19:54.833 --> 00:19:58.700
- Sure you will. Count on it.
- Pikachu.

348
00:19:58.766 --> 00:20:02.133
- Hm!
- Hm!

349
00:20:04.066 --> 00:20:07.433
- It’s time. I’ve got to get going.
- Oh, Bonnie.

350
00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.166
You’re leaving so soon?

351
00:20:09.233 --> 00:20:11.800
Next time you come visit, we’ll play again.

352
00:20:11.866 --> 00:20:13.866
- Mm-hm!
- Take care, everybody.

353
00:20:13.933 --> 00:20:15.133
Bye-bye, now.

354
00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:18.433
And thanks a lot for becoming friends with Bonnie.

355
00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.200
- Pika! Pika!
- Bonnie, let’s go.

356
00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.899
- See you soon. Bye!
- Bye-bye.

357
00:20:26.966 --> 00:20:29.500
- Take care of yourself.
- Bye, Bonnie. Bye.

358
00:20:29.566 --> 00:20:31.066
Bye!

359
00:20:32.166 --> 00:20:36.333
As Bonnie says goodbye to her new friends in the Lapras Defense Force,

360
00:20:36.399 --> 00:20:40.500
Lapras is safely back home and happily reunited with its family.

361
00:20:40.566 --> 00:20:43.733
Now our heroes are off to the Coumarine City Gym,

362
00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.966
as the journey continues.
